Package: BiostatVD
Title: Biostatistics Validation Dashboard
Version: 0.2.0
Description: R Shiny application for clinical trial study design calculations
    and validation. Supports group sequential IA boundary re-calculation
    (rpact), sample size planning under proportional hazards (rpact), and
    sample size planning under non-proportional hazards with delayed treatment
    effect (gsDesign2). Features flexible alpha/beta spending functions,
    fixed boundaries (gs_b), and per-stage test_upper control.
Authors@R: person("BiostatVD", "Team", role = c("aut", "cre"))
